Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer’s bookkeeping brief",
      "text": "Monthly bookkeeping order form\nBuyer: Minali Das, owner of Brindleleaf Crafts\nSeller: Varen Sen, independent bookkeeper\nService month: April 2025\n\nPlease reconcile the April bank and payment records, categorize the entries, and prepare a monthly profit-and-loss statement. The records will be provided as spreadsheets. Flag any entries that need clarification rather than guessing their category.\n\nAgreed fee: INR 8,500\nDelivery date: 10 May 2025\nDeliverable: reconciled April ledger and profit-and-loss statement\n\nPlease send the completed files by email. This order covers bookkeeping only; it does not include tax filing or an audit."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "Minali, 2 May, 09:10: I have sent the April spreadsheets. Please let me know if any entries are unclear.\nVaren, 2 May, 09:18: Received. I’ll reconcile them and prepare the profit-and-loss statement.\nMinali, 4 May, 14:05: The two entries marked supplies were both packaging purchases.\nVaren, 4 May, 14:12: Thanks, I’ll categorize them accordingly.\nVaren, 10 May, 16:20: I’ve emailed the reconciled ledger and statement for your review.\nMinali, 10 May, 17:02: Both files arrived and open correctly. Thank you.\nVaren, 10 May, 17:10: Glad to hear it. Please keep the source spreadsheets with your records."
    },
    {
      "title": "Invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nIssued: 10 May 2025\nFrom: Varen Sen, independent bookkeeper\nTo: Minali Das, Brindleleaf Crafts\n\nMonthly bookkeeping for April 2025\nBank and payment record reconciliation: INR 5,000\nEntry categorization and profit-and-loss statement: INR 3,500\nTotal due: INR 8,500\n\nDeliverables: reconciled April ledger and profit-and-loss statement\nDelivery date: 10 May 2025\nPayment method requested: PayPal\n\nThe fee covers the work described above. Tax filing, audit services, and bookkeeping for other months are not included. Please retain this invoice alongside the completed files and your original records."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: INR 8,500",
      "value": "INR 8,500"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: reconciled April ledger and profit-and-loss statement",
      "value": "reconciled April ledger and profit-and-loss statement"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 10 May 2025",
